  m_text: "Scatter appears on the 4th or 5th reel.\n2 Scatters on the same winning
    pay-line trigger 4 free spins.\nDuring those 4 free spins, a random Magic Dice
    Wild \nappears on every spin and\nlocks on one of the rows from 1st to 4th in
    the right order."
